  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere, Enhancement sphere (any (enhance) ability).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you enhance a creature, you may also give them a trait of your choice, just as if you had used shapeshift on them. Doing so makes the enhancement into a polymorph effect, but this can stack with other polymorph effects. A creature may only be under the effects of one enhancement modified in this way, but the trait they gained does not count towards the limit for your shapeshift.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc90\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
